# --- large data & derived artifacts (regenerable via scripts, iCloud-backed) ---
data/reports/
data/processed/
data/cache/
data/exports/
data/examples/*.wav
data/examples/*.mp3
outputs/
tmp/
.venv_uv_blocked/

# --- design binaries live outside git (Figma/exports too big for repo) ---
*.fig
*.zip
*.key

# --- audio never enters this repository, on any path ---
# Policy: docs/CORPUS_ETHICS.md — features are kept, source audio is deleted and
# never redistributed. The rules above were path-scoped, which let two Demucs
# vocal stems (~29 MB) and fifteen symlinks named after licensed tracks reach a
# public repo. These are format-scoped so no future path can repeat it.
*.mp3
*.wav
*.aiff
*.aif
*.flac
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.opus

# --- private experiment data: own recordings, licensed audio, stem caches ---
# Everything here is either Janek's own material or derived from it. The README
# is tracked so the convention survives; nothing else ever leaves this machine.
experiments_priv/*
!experiments_priv/README.md
